{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-82941","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-147394","text":"03 — Invocation Gateway"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82943","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147395","marks":["bold"],"text":"Purpose:"},{"id":"spn-147396","text":" How agent invocations flow through the Edge Function gateway, including the canonical request/response shapes, authentication, limit checks, session handling, streaming, and error normalization."}]}],"id":"blk-82942","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-82944","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-147397","text":"Gateway Overview"}]},{"id":"blk-82945","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147398","text":"The invocation gateway is a Supabase Edge Function at "},{"id":"spn-147399","marks":["code"],"text":"/functions/v1/invoke/:agentId"},{"id":"spn-147400","text":". It authenticates the caller, checks plan limits, resolves the active deployment, routes to the runtime provider adapter, and returns a normalized response."}]},{"id":"blk-82946","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-147401","text":"Request Shape ("},{"id":"spn-147402","marks":["code"],"text":"InvokeRequest"},{"id":"spn-147403","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-82947","kind":"code","language":"typescript","text":"interface InvokeRequest {\n  input: {\n    messages?: Array<{\n      role: \"system\" | \"user\" | \"assistant\" | \"tool\";\n      content: string;\n    }>;\n    prompt?: string;  // converted to messages if provided\n  };\n  sessionId?: string;  // opaque; provider-specific\n  options?: {\n    maxSteps?: number;\n    temperature?: number;\n    toolPolicy?: { allow?: string[]; deny?: string[] };\n  };\n  metadata?: {\n    traceId?: string;\n    client?: string;\n  };\n}"},{"id":"blk-82948","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147404","marks":["bold"],"text":"Rule:"},{"id":"spn-147405","text":" If "},{"id":"spn-147406","marks":["code"],"text":"prompt"},{"id":"spn-147407","text":" is provided instead of "},{"id":"spn-147408","marks":["code"],"text":"messages"},{"id":"spn-147409","text":", the gateway converts it to "},{"id":"spn-147410","marks":["code"],"text":"[{ role: \"user\", content: prompt }]"},{"id":"spn-147411","text":" before forwarding."}]},{"id":"blk-82949","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-147412","text":"Response Shape ("},{"id":"spn-147413","marks":["code"],"text":"InvokeResponse"},{"id":"spn-147414","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-82950","kind":"code","language":"typescript","text":"interface InvokeResponse {\n  output: {\n    text: string;\n    messages?: Array<{ role: string; content: string }>;\n  };\n  sessionId?: string;\n  usage: {\n    tokens?: number;\n    computeMs?: number;\n    toolCalls?: number;\n  };\n  traceId: string;\n  error?: NormalizedError;\n}"},{"id":"blk-82951","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-147415","text":"Gateway Pipeline"}]},{"id":"blk-82952","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"1. Parse request\n2. Authenticate (Supabase Auth JWT)\n3. Load agent record (RLS-filtered)\n4. Verify agent.status === \"active\"\n5. Resolve active deployment + runtime provider\n6. Check plan limits (billing_usage vs tier limits)\n7. Generate traceId (if not provided)\n8. Route to RPI adapter: invoke(input, sessionId, options)\n9. Normalize response\n10. Return to caller"},{"id":"blk-82953","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-147416","text":"Authentication"}]},{"id":"blk-82954","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147417","text":"All invocations require a valid Supabase Auth JWT in the "},{"id":"spn-147418","marks":["code"],"text":"Authorization"},{"id":"spn-147419","text":" header:"}]},{"id":"blk-82955","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Authorization: Bearer <supabase-jwt>"},{"id":"blk-82956","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147420","text":"The gateway extracts "},{"id":"spn-147421","marks":["code"],"text":"auth.uid()"},{"id":"spn-147422","text":" and uses it to load the agent via RLS. If the agent does not belong to the caller, the query returns empty and the gateway returns "},{"id":"spn-147423","marks":["code"],"text":"NOT_FOUND"},{"id":"spn-147424","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-82957","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147425","text":"Post-MVP: per-agent API keys for public invocation."}]},{"id":"blk-82958","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-147426","text":"Limit Checks"}]},{"id":"blk-82959","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147427","text":"Before routing to the provider, the gateway checks:"}]},{"id":"blk-82960","kind":"code","language":"sql","text":"SELECT total_requests, total_tokens, total_compute_ms\nFROM billing_usage\nWHERE user_id = auth.uid()\n  AND period_key = current_period();"},{"id":"blk-82961","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147428","text":"If any metric exceeds the user's tier limit, the gateway returns "},{"id":"spn-147429","marks":["code"],"text":"LIMIT_EXCEEDED"},{"id":"spn-147430","text":" without invoking the agent."}]},{"id":"blk-82962","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-147431","text":"Session Handling"}]},{"id":"blk-82963","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82965","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147432","text":"If "},{"id":"spn-147433","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-147434","text":" is provided, it is forwarded to the provider as-is."}]}],"id":"blk-82964","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82967","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147435","text":"If absent, the provider may create a new session and return the "},{"id":"spn-147436","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-147437","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-82966","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82969","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147438","text":"The gateway treats "},{"id":"spn-147439","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-147440","text":" as "},{"id":"spn-147441","marks":["bold"],"text":"opaque"},{"id":"spn-147442","text":" -- never parses or validates it."}]}],"id":"blk-82968","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-82971","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147443","text":"Session semantics are provider-specific (DO instance for Cloudflare, runtime"}]}],"id":"blk-82970","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-82972","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147444","text":"session for AgentCore)."}]},{"id":"blk-82973","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-147445","text":"Streaming"}]},{"id":"blk-82974","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147446","text":"When the provider supports streaming, the gateway uses Server-Sent Events (SSE):"}]},{"id":"blk-82975","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Content-Type: text/event-stream\n\ndata: {\"type\":\"chunk\",\"text\":\"Hello\"}\ndata: {\"type\":\"chunk\",\"text\":\" world\"}\ndata: {\"type\":\"done\",\"usage\":{\"tokens\":12,\"computeMs\":340}}"},{"id":"blk-82976","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147447","text":"When a provider does not support true streaming, the gateway MAY emulate it by returning the full response as a single chunk followed by "},{"id":"spn-147448","marks":["code"],"text":"done"},{"id":"spn-147449","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-82977","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-147450","text":"Error Normalization"}]},{"id":"blk-82978","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147451","text":"All errors are mapped to a standard code set:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-82980","spans":[{"id":"spn-147452","text":"Code"}]},{"id":"blk-82981","spans":[{"id":"spn-147453","text":"HTTP Status"}]},{"id":"blk-82982","spans":[{"id":"spn-147454","text":"Meaning"}]}],"id":"blk-82979","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-82983","spans":[{"id":"spn-147455","marks":["code"],"text":"UNAUTHENTICATED"}]},{"id":"blk-82984","spans":[{"id":"spn-147456","text":"401"}]},{"id":"blk-82985","spans":[{"id":"spn-147457","text":"Missing or invalid JWT"}]}],[{"id":"blk-82986","spans":[{"id":"spn-147458","marks":["code"],"text":"UNAUTHORIZED"}]},{"id":"blk-82987","spans":[{"id":"spn-147459","text":"403"}]},{"id":"blk-82988","spans":[{"id":"spn-147460","text":"Valid JWT but no access to this agent"}]}],[{"id":"blk-82989","spans":[{"id":"spn-147461","marks":["code"],"text":"NOT_FOUND"}]},{"id":"blk-82990","spans":[{"id":"spn-147462","text":"404"}]},{"id":"blk-82991","spans":[{"id":"spn-147463","text":"Agent does not exist (or not owned by caller)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-82992","spans":[{"id":"spn-147464","marks":["code"],"text":"LIMIT_EXCEEDED"}]},{"id":"blk-82993","spans":[{"id":"spn-147465","text":"429"}]},{"id":"blk-82994","spans":[{"id":"spn-147466","text":"Plan limit reached for this period"}]}],[{"id":"blk-82995","spans":[{"id":"spn-147467","marks":["code"],"text":"DEPLOYMENT_FAILED"}]},{"id":"blk-82996","spans":[{"id":"spn-147468","text":"502"}]},{"id":"blk-82997","spans":[{"id":"spn-147469","text":"No active deployment or deployment is broken"}]}],[{"id":"blk-82998","spans":[{"id":"spn-147470","marks":["code"],"text":"RUNTIME_ERROR"}]},{"id":"blk-82999","spans":[{"id":"spn-147471","text":"502"}]},{"id":"blk-83000","spans":[{"id":"spn-147472","text":"Provider returned an error during execution"}]}],[{"id":"blk-83001","spans":[{"id":"spn-147473","marks":["code"],"text":"INVALID_REQUEST"}]},{"id":"blk-83002","spans":[{"id":"spn-147474","text":"400"}]},{"id":"blk-83003","spans":[{"id":"spn-147475","text":"Malformed input or missing required fields"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-83004","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"LIMIT_EXCEEDED\",\n    \"message\": \"Monthly request limit reached. Upgrade your plan.\",\n    \"traceId\": \"tr_abc123\"\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-83005","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147476","marks":["bold"],"text":"Rule:"},{"id":"spn-147477","text":" Error messages must be safe for display. Never include secrets or internal stack traces."}]},{"id":"blk-83006","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-147478","text":"Rate Limiting"}]},{"id":"blk-83007","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147479","text":"The gateway SHOULD enforce per-user and per-agent rate limits beyond plan quotas:"}]},{"id":"blk-83008","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83010","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147480","text":"Per-user: max N requests/second across all agents"}]}],"id":"blk-83009","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83012","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147481","text":"Per-agent: max M requests/second per agent"}]}],"id":"blk-83011","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83014","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147482","text":"Payload size: max 1 MB request body"}]}],"id":"blk-83013","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-83015","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-147483","text":"Checklist"}]},{"id":"blk-83016","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83018","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147484","text":"[ ] Every invocation is authenticated via Supabase Auth JWT"}]}],"id":"blk-83017","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83020","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147485","text":"[ ] Agent status is verified as "},{"id":"spn-147486","marks":["code"],"text":"active"},{"id":"spn-147487","text":" before routing"}]}],"id":"blk-83019","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83022","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147488","text":"[ ] Plan limits are checked before invoking the provider"}]}],"id":"blk-83021","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83024","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147489","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-147490","marks":["code"],"text":"traceId"},{"id":"spn-147491","text":" is generated or forwarded on every request"}]}],"id":"blk-83023","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83026","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147492","text":"[ ] Errors are normalized to the standard code set"}]}],"id":"blk-83025","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83028","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147493","text":"[ ] Error messages never contain secrets or internal details"}]}],"id":"blk-83027","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83030","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147494","text":"[ ] "},{"id":"spn-147495","marks":["code"],"text":"sessionId"},{"id":"spn-147496","text":" is treated as opaque"}]}],"id":"blk-83029","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83032","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147497","text":"[ ] Streaming uses SSE format when supported"}]}],"id":"blk-83031","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-83034","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-147498","text":"[ ] Request payload size is validated"}]}],"id":"blk-83033","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraenucf3s5f5qly5jomki66canq4bi4xrltopyugobld6qyqrdo5uq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}